WEBVTT

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:05.380
Come moe, come moe, kyun.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.040
A fortuitous moment, the heart goes thump.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.920
Japan's first ever maid, Omoe.

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:14.790
In the early Meiji period when social stratification
was still engrained in society,

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:18.670
she served all masters without distinction,

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:23.000
and enamored the people of Akiha-no-hara
with violence and moe.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:30.000
After her death, an annual festival called the
Lady Omoe Climb was established in her honor.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:34.080
It is a fighting festival where maids compete for the top

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.580
in the name of honor and pride.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.250
Welcome home, Master

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.330
Welcome home, Mistress

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.330
Welcome home, Master

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.330
Welcome home, Mistress

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:07.380
Welcome home, Master

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.580
Omelet fully loaded with chicken and rice

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.460
Make it yummy, moe moe kyun

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.830
With plenty of milk and plenty of love

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.670
Let's cast a spell, moe moe kyun

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.920
Seeing sooo many masters here makes me so happy, oink!

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.380
Fresh out of Moe Moe Forest

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.000
This maid's going whole hog, oink!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.380
Welcome home, Master

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:33.420
Kawaii is justice, oink!

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.460
My makeup's just the bomb, like, O.M.G.!

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.960
Ramen, extra veggies, topped with sauce, fat, and garlic aplenty

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:42.170
Welcome home to the pigsty!

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.130
Hey! (Yeah!) This is my maid way! (Whoo!)

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.880
Shot through your heart like, Boom! Boom! Boom! (Alright!)

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.830
Take an instax with the scumbag

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.290
Hey! (Yeah!) Maid princesses from Hell! (Whoo!)

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.920
Stan for me or, Blam! Blam! Blam! (Okay)

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.960
Petticoats whirl in a scuffle

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:59.710
Hide-and-seek at the maid cafe

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.420
Nice service for booming sales

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.210
Falling in love is a big no-no

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:05.540
A cutesy garden of secrets

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:11.710
Akiba Creatures Go Wild!

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:11.710
Let the Moe Festivities Begin!!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.080
So, I hear you've been raking it in recently.

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.290
Guess I can't complain.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.670
But I hear some shady rumors as well.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.790
That your cafe's bringing in customers
by pushing drugs.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:18.460
Huh?

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:21.130
Oh, of course widdle teddy here
doesn't believe any of that.

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:23.960
But if Miss Nagi were to catch wind of it...

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.380
Y'know what killed the cat?
I'll have you stuffed.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.830
Bring it on.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:31.330
I'll skin that dense hide of yours and
make a shamisen out of it.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.540
Sit.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:41.750
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:48.540
This year's Akiba Maid Festival will be special in that
the Creatureland Group will be the sole organizer.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.380
Now that those pesky extraterrestrials are gone, yes.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:55.830
Having a single group organize the festival
is a first in Akiba history.

00:02:56.130 --> 00:03:00.460
Indeed, for the Lady Omoe Climb in particular,
we are overseeing all of the arrangements,

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:04.130
so that all the cafes understand that Dazzlion,
the one Miss Nagi personally manages,

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:06.210
is supposed to win.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.000
The time has come.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.830
We will show Akiba that we are
the ultimate ecosystem of Creatures.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.460
Wow! What's that?

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.710
That's Lady Omoe.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.670
We all climb her at the end of the festival.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.040
Sounds like fun!

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.330
Maids fight it out and
literally kick each other down, though.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:25.960
Fight?

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.630
The maid who wins becomes
Lady Omoe for the coming year.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:32.750
That means better priority in the group
and more customers for the cafe.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.000
What?! Then we should totally go for that!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.210
Nah, no way.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:40.000
The starting order for the Lady Omoe Climb
is based on food stall profits.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:43.460
Last year, the race was done
before we even got to start.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.790
But if we work really hard on the food stall-

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:49.630
Huh!  I thought it reeked of pig.
No wonder.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.250
Wh-what do you want?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.330
Huh? What's that swine?
Why are you talking?

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:57.750
I hear you pigs have been rather upiggy recently.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.790
I mean, "uppity" recently.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.540
I wouldn't say that.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:05.330
A couple of feisty newbies put ideas
into your head, huh?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.540
That's not true.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:07.710
Nah, of course not!

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.500
You know you pigs are always
at the bottom of the heap!

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:13.500
You can have at it with non-affiliates all you want,

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.710
but you'd better keep to the creature pecking order.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:19.880
Okachimachi!

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.330
Water! Water!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.540
How could they be so awful?

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.630
It's just what we get as a maid cafe ranked dead last.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:34.080
Pig's Feet

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:31.210
We hardly ever run into maids from
other affiliate cafes outside the festival,

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:34.080
so they love getting the chance
to make fun of us every year.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.830
It's not like you two to put up with trash talk!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.830
There's no point in going against a higher ranked cafe.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.920
What she said.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.540
You don't want another bloody turf war
on our hands, do you?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.580
Well no, but...

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:48.960
C'mon! Let's get this tent up
and go help Ranko and the others.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:52.330
Creatureland

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:52.330
Ecosystem Guidelines

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:51.830
These are the guidelines for this year's festival.

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:54.040
Read it over thoroughly!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.670
Ok-reature!

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.380
This year's festival is a special one indeed.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:01.080
Read every word, every sentence carefully,

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.670
and beat them into all of your pigsty maids!

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:04.880
Ok-reature!

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:11.920
Evening, sir!

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:14.540
Make sure your tiny piggy brains understand-

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:17.960
Huh? I wonder what that was about?

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:22.000
Sheesh! It's miniscule!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.250
Chief?

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.920
Oh, hey, welcome back.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:28.460
Pig's Feet

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:28.460
Pig's Feet

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.880
Pig's feet?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.460
Last year we sold colored piglets.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.960
Colored piglets?!

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.210
But why?

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:34.630
There are plenty of other festival stalls,
like shaved ice and candy apples...

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:36.670
The higher-ranked cafes take all the good ones.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.710
We're too bottom-rung to get to do those.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:40.040
I see...

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:43.540
Well, pig's feet are a great source
of collagen, you know?

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:46.210
What does she mean by "bottom-rung"?

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:47.420
Oh...

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:50.000
Our group has what they call the "Moe Moe Hierarchy."

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.040
And we're ranked at the very bottom.

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.630
Why are we ranked so low?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:06:00.710
Well see, cafes that do dirty work for the higher ups,
or offer lots of sweets money,

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.420
or have a bond of sisterhood with a better cafe
are ranked higher.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.630
We have none of that, so we're down at the bottom.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:07.830
Get it?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.630
I understand the structure, at least.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:10.790
The bottom...

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.710
Can we cut this talk?
It's a total buzzkill.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:14.920
You're right.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.960
We just have to stick it out for the festival.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:18.880
Yep, just have to keep our heads down.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:22.080
Zoya, can you break down and bundle
the empty boxes?

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.080
Of course!

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.710
There we go.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:28.750
Creatureland

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:28.750
Ecosystem Guidelines

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:28.790
What is the meaning of this?

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.500
Are you worried that we might lose?

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.880
Oh, of course not.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:35.250
We merely devised some arrangements
to ensure total lion victory.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.170
What is Miss Nagi worried about?

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:39.830
We are the king of beasts.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.420
We don't need any arrangements to get to the top.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.250
But of course!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.250
Your victory is unassailable.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.750
This is but a formality.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:54.040
Go tell Miss Nagi that we will show her
an elegant victory.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:57.210
Moe moe rawr!

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.080
Your rawr!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.290
What an honor!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.420
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:04.630
Hello?

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:05.830
It's me.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:07.380
Ok-reature!

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:10.000
I'm running a final check about the guidelines.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.210
I trust your maids all know the deal?

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.540
Oh, uh, of course.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:18.210
If any of you violate those guidelines,
we will be disowning Oinky Doink.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.000
Is there a problem?

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.290
Oh, not at all!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.580
Crap, crap! The guidelines!

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.040
Uh, somewhere around here...

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:33.000
It was here, wasn't it?!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:36.670
Pig's Feet

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.790
Huh? What the...

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.630
Looks flashier than yesterday, huh?

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.170
Oh! Good morning!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.500
Nagomi?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.540
It's a festival, after all!

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.380
It's a shame to have to keep our heads down!

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:48.130
If we make lots of masters happy,
I'm sure it will be that much more fun!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.210
You've been at this since the morning?

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:51.210
Yes!

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.960
Your face is smudged.
Wipe it off later.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.580
Well, might as well enjoy the festival, huh?

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.210
The cuter the better, I say!

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.250
Exactly! Let's do our best!

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:07.540
Pig's Feet

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.880
Uh? Is something wrong?

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.670
It's just, I haven't seen the chief anywhere.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:10.500
Uh, whatever.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.710
It doesn't make a difference either way.

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.460
C'mon, let's get ready.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.420
Man, I feel bad.

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:22.420
They're probably all panicking right now
with me missing, huh?

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:27.920
Now, welcome home, welcome home,
welcome home all.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:32.960
Masters and Mistresses, we truly appreciate
seeing such a large turnout lined up today.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:36.880
Every single maid cafe in Akiba
is gathered all together here today,

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:40.540
so at every stall and every performance
the sky's the limit for moe, moe 'til you drop,

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.540
covering every possible genre of moe,
a moe moe festival.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:47.420
Akiba Maid Festival

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:47.420
The Akiba Maid Festival begins now!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:53.500
Moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun,
moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:56.790
Moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun,
moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:01.830
Pig's feet?

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.330
Would you like one?

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.830
Um, where are the outhouses?

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.710
The outhouses are that way, oink.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.460
Thank you.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:11.130
We're not here to point out the outhouses, jeez.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:12.790
It's been how many times now?

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.420
That was the twenty-sixth time.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.880
Master, welcome home.

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.580
Miss Ranko, I love...

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.580
pig's feet.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.170
Would you wrap up two pig's worth for me?

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:28.880
Gladly.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.250
That customer's totally after Ranko, isn't he?

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.670
He's been at the cafe all the time recently.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:39.170
Yeah, he's pretty distinctive.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:47.630
I'll stop by the cafe again.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:51.500
We eagerly await your return to the pigsty.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.380
What did he give you, Ranko?

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:58.960
Oh, acorns.

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.750
What pigs love best!

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:04.540
So this is what pig's feet are like.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.830
Interesting, this texture's a first.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.000
I'm so glad you all came by!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:14.920
We searched all over the venue but we couldn't
find you on the map and we almost gave up.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.290
May I take a look at that?

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.920
Oh, s-sure.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:24.290
O

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:21.880
Huh?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.500
Think this might be us?

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.920
Does that stand for "outhouse"?

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.290
That's why they keep asking for the outhouses.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.960
They really don't give a crap about us.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.130
No wonder no one's coming.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.420
If they're not going to come to us,

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.460
we'll just go to them!

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:46.080
Pig's feet from Oinky Doink!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.750
Freshly chopped off pig's feet!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.290
They're hoglicious!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.670
Get your pig's feet!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.040
Pig's feet from Oinky Doink!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:57.170
My pig's feet!

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.080
Nagomi!

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.380
Nagomi!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.330
Where's your swine of a manager?!

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.170
You really suck at life, you know that?

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.210
You can't do anything right.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.830
Nothing good has happened
your entire life, remember?

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.290
You think so?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.040
They'll figure things out without you there.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.630
They don't need you.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.580
Maybe you're right.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.830
I mean, no one's coming to find you, right?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.130
Just make a run for it.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.460
Yeah...

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.130
Maybe I will, after I catch a fish.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.170
We asked where your manager is, bozos.

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:48.540
She's not here.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:49.790
Is something the matter?

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:53.460
This pighead was walking around
snorting and selling stuff.

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:54.920
You're gonna pay.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.920
Want us to ram pig's feet in your ears
and rattle your molars around?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.210
Zoya!

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:01.790
What? You got a problem?

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.880
You're asking for a beating, huh?!

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:05.250
Not now.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.040
We're very sorry.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.540
This here pig's smart!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.170
She knows her place in the Moe Moe Hierarchy.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.670
Yumechi...

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.830
Hands on the ground.
All of you.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.170
Didn'tcha hear me? Huh?!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:20.750
All right.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:21.750
Don't!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:23.670
I did it all on my own!

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.380
I'm so very sorry!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:29.500
You think your groveling means anything, idiot?

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:30.960
Ow!

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.670
Come on, hurry the hell up.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.080
Of course.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.500
Yumechi, no!

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:36.710
It's fine.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.000
We're so very sorry.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:47.080
Here's a hoofprint for ya.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:49.920
This way, you won't forget your place, hmm?

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:52.380
Don'tcha dare leave your pigsty again.

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:55.710
Pigs are supposed to keep their noses to
the ground and keep rooting around.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:59.080
That way maybe you'll find
a truffle or something once in a while!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:03.920
I'm sorry...

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.630
I shouldn't have gone and done that.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.210
I don't understand.

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:13.080
If we fight back, they'll close us down for sure this time.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.420
We have to grin and bear it.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.920
No, that's not what I mean.

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.580
Why is Oinky Doink at the bottom?

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.670
You're all top-notch maids.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.130
Top-notch maids?

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.130
Ranko's right!

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.380
Yumechi's given up being human in a good way,

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:35.290
Shiipon's crazy hyper and ready to party,

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.960
and Zoya's so much better at smiling now.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:41.670
Ranko's ketchup doodles aren't awful anymore.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.460
And Okachimachi is a real panda!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.920
You're all amazing maids!

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.250
Then let's prove it.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:50.750
How do we do that?

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:55.080
What do you think our pig's feet are for?

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:59.790
Moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun,
moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:03.000
Moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun,
moe moe kyun kyun, moe moe kyun kyun!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.830
Apparently we have the highest attendance
in the history of the festival.

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:10.330
Is that so?

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:15.960
The maids who contribute to the group
will gain wealth, fame, and power.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:20.000
Any maids who fail will be cast to the bottom
to serve as a lesson.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.250
Yes!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:26.080
We've made sure to engrain the Moe Moe Hierarchy
within the maids for the benefit of the group.

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:29.580
As such, the Creatureland Group's
ecosystem is absolute.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.000
It's not just the Creatureland Group.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:37.250
Akiba itself is a creature that grows
off of people's greed.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:41.330
Today, I'll prove that I'm at the apex of Akiba.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:46.170
Akiba Maid Festival

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.080
King of beasts!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.580
King of Akiba!

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:51.170
Rawr rawr!

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:52.380
Win again this year!

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.790
Got the guidelines in your head?

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:58.750
We make things look extremely close and
make sure the lions win in the end.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:02.580
Right, assume we're goners
if we take even a step out of line.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.500
Come on, Moomoo!
You've got to win this year!

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:08.380
We're going for the win, moo!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:09.380
Moo!

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.250
Let's do this, mraww!

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:12.460
Bear!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.920
You all ready?

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:20.630
Yes! Let's win!

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:21.040
Indeed.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.040
They're dead!
Indeed.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.040
We'll show 'em this year's different!

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.920
Let's show 'em what pigs are made of!

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:28.420
Okie dokie!

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:29.920
Oinky Doink!

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.710
Okay now, Masters and Mistresses,

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:35.750
please cheer them on until your vocal chords
are shredded to the bone.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.710
Once they start running they can't stop.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:41.210
Anything goes from moe moe to bashity bash.
A festival melee!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:42.880
The main event!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:45.750
The Lady Omoe Climb is about to begin!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.710
Moe moe...

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:56.580
Go!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.920
Dazzlion!

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.790
Aren't we allowed to go yet?

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.960
They sounded the gun.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.460
There's no reason we should have to wait quietly.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.290
Let's go!

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.540
This way is open!

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.420
Whaddaya think you're doing?!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:12.830
Didn'tcha read the guidelines?!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:15.380
Drill the ecosystem into your heads!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.000
Here comes Oinky Doink!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.420
Dream pig, go go!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.130
Don't think I know that cafe.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.130
Pigs?

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:28.880
What is that?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.080
Why are those pigs...

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.500
Comply with the ecosystem!

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.080
Let us through!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.540
Stick to the guidelines!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:50.920
Fucking swine!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:54.920
Whoa, are you kidding?

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:56.750
Are the underdogs going for it?!

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.460
D-don't worry!

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.580
This doesn't change the fact that the lions will win!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.000
What's going on down there?

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.380
We're almost at the top!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:20.170
You think it's okay for you pigs to be here?!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:23.000
Whatever! Like we care!

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.750
Haven't you read it?!

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.170
Like hell we're gonna read the room!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.130
No, no! Not that!

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:30.130
Just shut the hell up!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.460
Yumechi!

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:32.670
On it!

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:35.790
Even pigs...

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:40.130
Even pigs can climb if you flatter them enough!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:43.210
Won't you quit that rowdy snorting?

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:46.330
Yumechi!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.000
Good work, lions.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.670
Damn it...

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.580
That's it, then?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.540
Whoa, here it comes, here it comes,
here it comes!

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:58.920
My first catch!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:15.880
Nagomi?

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.580
Are you gonna die?

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.380
You little...

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.080
I'll go!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.420
Nagomi?!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.960
Stop! This is for your own good!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.040
Okay! Please just listen!

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.000
Back down! I'll give you salmon if you do!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:45.960
Take that!

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.330
Relentless pig...

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:04.540
Just fall already!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:11.500
You pigs should be selling pig's feet or some crap
at the bottom of the heap!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.080
Here's the pig's foot you wanted, oink.

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.330
Ranko!

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.500
You're done!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:29.880
Ranko!

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:33.880
<i>Nagomi, allow me to send you off.</i>

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:37.210
Damn it, you fucking pig!

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:44.630
Go!

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:45.290
Go!

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.290
Go!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.380
Go!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.670
Go!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:53.170
No...

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.750
Our ecosystem's going to fall apart.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.000
It's the end...

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.500
Looking for a rom-ham-tic time?!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.210
Come to Oinky Doink Cafe!

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:15.420
She did it!

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:17.130
A pig took the top!

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.830
Yesss!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:33.210
Pigs? At the top of the ecosystem?!

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:42.130
Thank you! Thank you!

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:45.630
It's time to present the winner of
the Lady Omoe Climb.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:51.670
Our new Lady Omoe maid will stand at the pinnacle
of all Akiba maids for the coming year,

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:55.420
to provide auspicious service to
all of you Masters and Mistresses.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:57.710
Here to present the auspicious Lady Omoe title

00:20:57.710 --> 00:20:59.790
Here to present the auspicious Lady Omoe title
Whew, she's alive.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:03.000
is the head representative of
the Creatureland Group, Miss Nagi!

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.670
Representative?

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:12.630
She's gone and done it now.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:14.380
The head's gonna take her out.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.330
What a surprising result.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.630
You have plenty of promise.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.630
Thank you so much!

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:25.460
Oinky Doink, congratulations!

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:27.790
Pretty impressive.
Let's check them out sometime.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:33.580
Whether this maid who became the new Lady Omoe
today is truly worthy of this honor

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.250
is a question we will find out soon enough.

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.830
This Year's

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.830
Lady Omoe

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:38.540
Speak.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.000
R-right!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:44.920
Uh, I'm Nagomi from Oinky Doink Cafe!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:49.250
Masters, Mistresses,
we eagerly await your return to our pigsty!

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:54.500
Hey, that's one of our maids!

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:56.380
The one who's making the speech now, ours!

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:58.080
I practically raised her!

00:22:26.670 --> 00:22:31.580
Another day, another chance to go moe moe kyun

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:38.000
I come to the pigsty for my moe moe kyun

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:44.000
That's the sort of life I lead

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:53.790
Mock me, and you just might bleed

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:59.380
Is the hesitation that wells up

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:08.210
The lingering scent of a humane soul?

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:15.290
Whether you get to live or die

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:21.130
Tread your own path

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:27.500
Have the guts to pull that trigger

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:33.830
Who are you

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:40.750
Show me through the pain
